//HEAVY CROSSBOW +1 - 2000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/XBOW02.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Heavy Crossbow"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "A crossbow is a bow mounted crosswise on a wooden or metal shaft, the latter called a tiller. The bow is usually made of ash or yew. The crossbow fires a quarrel (also called a bolt). 

STATISTICS:

Damage: +4 (missile)
Speed Factor: 9
Proficiency Type: Crossbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 12 Strength

Weight: 14"

SAY NAME2 "Heavy Crossbow +1"
	SAY DESC "A crossbow is a bow mounted crosswise on a wooden or metal shaft, the latter called a tiller. The bow is usually made of ash or yew. The crossbow fires a quarrel (also called a bolt). This heavy crossbow has been enchanted.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +1
Damage: +5 (missile)
Speed Factor: 8
Proficiency Type: Crossbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 12 Strength

Weight: 12" 






