//THE GUIDE +2 - 6000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/XBOW03.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Heavy Crossbow"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "A crossbow is a bow mounted crosswise on a wooden or metal shaft, the latter called a tiller. The bow is usually made of ash or yew. The crossbow fires a quarrel (also called a bolt). 

STATISTICS:

Damage: +4 (missile)
Speed Factor: 9
Proficiency Type: Crossbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 12 Strength

Weight: 14"

SAY NAME2 "The Guide +2"
	SAY DESC "A favored siege weapon of King Shastir Longeve, crossbows of this type were designed for the systematic removal of defensive forces thought safe behind the battlements of castles. Scant few of these weapons survive to this day, mainly due to the eventual annihilation of the king's forces by a coalition of subjugated lands.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +5
Damage: +6 (missile)
Speed Factor: 7
Proficiency Type: Crossbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 12 Strength

Weight: 11" 




//HEAVY CROSSBOW OF DOOM +2 - 7000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BDXBOW02.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Heavy Crossbow"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "A crossbow is a bow mounted crosswise on a wooden or metal shaft, the latter called a tiller. The bow is usually made of ash or yew. The crossbow fires a quarrel (also called a bolt). 

STATISTICS:

Damage: +4 (missile)
Speed Factor: 9
Proficiency Type: Crossbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 12 Strength

Weight: 14"

SAY NAME2 "Heavy Crossbow of Doom +2"
	SAY DESC "The Heavy Crossbow of Doom was forged by duergar smiths in the deep Underdark, infused with necrotic energy. Commissioned by the vengeful drow priestess Zilvra Fey-Branche to execute traitors from a distance, the weapon whispers faintly when loaded. Upon impact, its bolts unleash a suffocating aura of despair, sapping the victim's will to fight. After the bloody fall of her house, the crossbow remained lost in the depths, highly prized by Underdark assassins for its ability to break a target's spirit before the final blow.

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
– Cast Doom on the target (Save vs. Wand at -4 negates)

THAC0: +2
Damage: +6
Damage type: Missile
Speed Factor: 7
Proficiency Type: Crossbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 12 Strength

Weight: 11" 




//VITRIOL CROSSBOW +3 - 9000mo//
