	SAY NAME1 "Heavy Crossbow"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "A crossbow is a bow mounted crosswise on a wooden or metal shaft, the latter called a tiller. The bow is usually made of ash or yew. The crossbow fires a quarrel (also called a bolt). 

STATISTICS:

Damage: +4 (missile)
Speed Factor: 9
Proficiency Type: Crossbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 12 Strength

Weight: 14"

SAY NAME2 "Vitriol Crossbow +3"
	SAY DESC "A marvel of engineering, this crossbow coats bolts in a highly corrosive, acidic compound and releases them with deadly precision. It is enchanted as well, likely to protect the intricate mechanisms from being dissolved by its own lethal payload. It bears the hallmarks of the inventor's god, Gond.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +3
Damage: +7, +3 acid damage
Damage type: Missile
Speed Factor: 6
Proficiency Type: Crossbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 12 Strength

Weight: 10" 





//TITAN'S DRAW +3 - 11000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/XBOW08.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Heavy Crossbow"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "A crossbow is a bow mounted crosswise on a wooden or metal shaft, the latter called a tiller. The bow is usually made of ash or yew. The crossbow fires a quarrel (also called a bolt). 

STATISTICS:

Damage: +4 (missile)
Speed Factor: 9
Proficiency Type: Crossbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 12 Strength

Weight: 14"

SAY NAME2 "Titan's Draw +3"
	SAY DESC "Carved from the calcified rib bone of a prehistoric behemoth, this monstrous weapon utilizes the impossibly thick tresses of a frost giant matron for its bowstring. The structural tension is so immense that lesser warriors cannot even budge the loading crank, requiring the muscle of a titan just to chamber a bolt. When fired, the kinetic force is terrifying; the projectile strikes with the impact of a falling meteor, shattering bones and hurling grown men backward, leaving them utterly dazed on the battlefield.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Critical hit chance: +5% with this weapon 

Combat abilities:
- On a Critical hit opponent is knocked back and stunned for one round (Save vs. Wand at -4 negates)

THAC0: +3
Damage: +7, +4 crushing damage
Damage type: Missile
Speed Factor: 6
Proficiency Type: Crossbow
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 20 Strength

Weight: 28" 